url: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17798456"  # Will be assigned by Zenodo after archiving
abstract: >
  A reproducible Python pipeline for applying BERTopic (neural topic modeling) 
  to focus group transcripts. Includes systematic hyperparameter exploration, 
  bootstrap stability analysis, multi-criteria model selection, and comparison 
  with LDA baseline. Designed for small conversational qualitative datasets.
keywords:
  - topic modeling
  - BERTopic
  - transformers
  - focus groups
  - qualitative analysis
  - natural language processing
  - reproducible research
